# Summary

- The charter says: Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-0058656a9845a0976227d4458d5cc4168a5496b1 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

- The annex fixes the amount: Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-0fa403b30c833aba1ddd053cf5e0950f68eb4f51 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]

- Therefore, each member pays one hundred twenty (120) EUR per year. [[cite:obs-0058656a9845a0976227d4458d5cc4168a5496b1 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]][[cite:obs-0fa403b30c833aba1ddd053cf5e0950f68eb4f51 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
